'' A UDT AS asc's POSITION, a 'mid( ) =' position, a REDIM bound and a PRINT USING item runs its
'' numeric cast. tiko declined the first three and clang refused the last. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/udt-numarg2.bas -o tests/codegen/udtnumarg2.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/udtnumarg2.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [l]99
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [l]abZdef
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [l] 1 3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [l] 3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [d2] 4.25
